components.description:
Exact block, identical in Foundations and Remi.dc.html:
--paper: oklch(0.975 0.007 85); --paper-raised: oklch(0.99 0.004 85); --ink: oklch(0.23 0.012 70); --ink-muted: oklch(0.47 0.012 70); --ink-faint: oklch(0.58 0.01 75); --hairline: oklch(0.9 0.008 80);
--pc-accent: oklch(0.5 0.1 128); --pc-accent-soft: color-mix(in oklch, var(--pc-accent) 13%, var(--paper)); --fi-accent: oklch(0.5 0.1 265); --fi-accent-soft: color-mix(in oklch, var(--fi-accent) 13%, var(--paper));
--risk: oklch(0.7 0.13 70); --overload: oklch(0.56 0.17 28); --done: oklch(0.74 0.008 85); --focus: oklch(0.35 0.02 80);
--font-ui: "Albert Sans", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; --font-display: "Libre Caslon Text", Georgia, serif; --font-numeric: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
--radius-s: 3px; --radius-m: 6px;
--space-1: 4px; --space-2: 8px; --space-3: 12px; --space-4: 16px; --space-5: 24px; --space-6: 32px; --space-7: 48px; --space-8: 64px;
--dur-fast: 140ms; --dur-base: 240ms; --dur-slow: 440ms;
--ease-out: cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
--spring-soft: linear(0, 0.049 5%, 0.156 10%, 0.283 15%, 0.408 20%, 0.522 25%, 0.62 30%, 0.702 35%, 0.769 40%, 0.864 50%, 0.922 60%, 0.956 70%, 0.976 80%, 0.987 90%, 1);
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ :root{ --spring-soft: steps(1, jump-start); } }
The app also adds :root[data-motion="reduced"]{ --spring-soft: steps(1, jump-start); } for the in-app Motion tweak.
Global CSS: html,body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-ui);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased} (the app adds height:100% and text-rendering:optimizeLegibility). button,input,textarea{font:inherit;color:inherit}. a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration-color:var(--hairline);text-underline-offset:3px} a:hover{color:var(--pc-accent)}. The app adds ::selection{background:color-mix(in oklch, var(--pc-accent) 22%, transparent)}.
Colour roles as documented:
- --paper: page background
- --paper-raised: drawer preview, palette, inputs
- --ink: text, primary buttons, today
- --ink-muted: secondary text, 6.3:1 on paper
- --ink-faint: idle checkboxes and separators, not for body text
- --hairline: rules and outlines
- --pc-accent: Private Credit; --pc-accent-soft: PC project fills and chips
- --fi-accent: Fixed Income; --fi-accent-soft: FI project fills and rotation
- --risk: at risk (overrun past target, stale)
- --overload: a day over 8h
- --done: done, shown as a quiet strike-through
- --focus: focus border on inputs
Group notes:
- Paper and ink: 'Warm off-white paper, near-black ink. Saturation stays under 0.01.'
- Domains: 'One accent per domain; same lightness and chroma, different hue. Soft tints derive from the accent.'
- Status: 'Used sparingly. Chip text mixes the status colour into ink so it holds 4.5:1.'
